pan><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b31099c127fe934aEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e5afaa488b63fbd1END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_FOR_Bottomless_HermitBook2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_FOR_Bottomless_HermitBook2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_FOR_Bottomless_HermitBook2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0eb19717-e850-4fc5-a3fb-910d06ddd916</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0eb19717-e850-4fc5-a3fb-910d06ddd916\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0eb19717-e850-4fc5-a3fb-910d06ddd916\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-513&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-408</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A journal filled with hastily sketched diagrams of spiders and various spell runes. The captions are largely written in code, save for a few passages near the end that are penned in shaky Common.]\n</p><p><br>\nThey can sense my devotion. It draws them. I hear them in the shadows, whispers from the dark mother.\n</p><p><br>\n...\n</p><p><br>\nI woke to a gift wrapped in spider's silk: a pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Spiderstep_Boots\" title=\"Spiderstep Boots\">boots</a>, taken from a heretic's corpse. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lolth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lolth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lolth\">Lolth</a></span> sends her daughters to reward my faith, to let me know I am on the right path.\n</p><p><br>\n...\n</p><p><br>\nAnother gift: the corpse of a <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">drow</a>, sigils scarred upon his face. An arachnomancer - one with the power to inhabit the spider's form. It is a message, a calling. My blood already dries upon the dagger, her blessed image carved into my skin.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Journal\" title=\"Bloody Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Book_Hermit_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bloody_Journal\" title=\"Bloody Journal\">Bloody Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burnt_Journal\" title=\"Burnt Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Book_Hermit_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Burnt_Journal\" title=\"Burnt Journal\">Burnt Journal</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Web-Covered_Journal\" title=\"Web-Covered Journal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Book_Hermit_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Web-Covered_Journal\" title=\"Web-Covered Journal\">Web-Covered Journal</a></span></li></ul>\n<p>Reading all four books grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#A_Solitary_Spider\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A Solitary Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#A_Solitary_Spider\" title=\"Sage\">A Solitary Spider</a> inspiration to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.090 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3791/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47844/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15777/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function c